Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.50,0:00:12.65,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,220)\blur0.6}The Spirit of Jehovah
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.60,0:00:16.82,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,220)\blur0.6}Is resting upon Me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.77,0:00:21.17,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,220)\blur0.6}I'm anointed by my Father
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.12,0:00:25.66,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,220)\blur0.6}To bring hope to the weary
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.61,0:00:29.67,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,220)\blur0.6}To bring love to the lost
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.57,0:00:38.92,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,220)\blur0.6}You have sent me with the promise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.87,0:00:43.72,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,220)\blur0.6}For the broken to be healed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.67,0:00:48.41,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,220)\blur0.6}Chains are breaking hearts are rising
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.36,0:00:53.66,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,220)\blur0.6}As Your freedom is revealed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.61,0:00:57.03,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,220)\blur0.6}Jesus God's Anointed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.98,0:01:01.59,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,220)\blur0.6}Lifting burdens giving hope
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.54,0:01:05.93,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,220)\blur0.6}Binding wounds You heal my pain
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.88,0:01:10.36,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,220)\blur0.6}Pouring gladness over me
